   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run FastH3, FastVideo's 8-step version of MiniMax-H3, on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M5 or newer, 36 GB or more). The workflow makes a 5 second clip with sound at 1344x768 with the fasth3 recipe: gmlx Sigmas gives the 8 noise levels FastH3 was trained at, and ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3 sets the recipe's shifts, 10 and 3. The largest clip each Mac makes is in the video guide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/video.html#clip-length-size-and-memory\n\nFastH3 runs text to video only, so leave first_frame and last_frame unconnected. Read the model's license before you use the clips: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/video.html#licenses\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx video pull fasth3\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ]
  },
